taskhandler provides CMake targets:

    find_package(TaskHandler CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE TaskHandler::task_handler)

    # or the header-only target:
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE TaskHandler::header_only)

The C++ namespace is conan. The vcpkg / pkg-config / Conan package name is
taskhandler. Pick one CMake target per binary and do not mix them.
